        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion W2, Von Braun Stainless Steel Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Von Braun Handleset is as stylish as it is durable. The modern design is accentuated through this very contemporary material. We all know that stainless steel is built to last and that it looks great. This modern door handle is available in either brushed stainless steel or polished stainless steel. Choose your favorite trim, from square knobs to modern levers. The Von Braun Stainless steel Handleset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/von-braun-entryset-fusion-e-w2\"><b>Matching Von Braun Entryset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Von Braun Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion W2 Von Braun Modern Front Door Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2 on center door boring</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</B>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
